  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27544001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "葵？你在哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "跑到哪里去了，刚刚还在的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呣~~（伸懒腰），怎么了主人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我的水杯……葵在这种地方也能睡着吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "没事的，只是一些水，擦干就可以了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "唉，还真是让人担心啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "来，这是你的葵瓜子小屋，以后就可以在这里睡觉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "向日葵枕头、瓜子形状的抱枕……居然还是隔音玻璃？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，这样的话，就不会有声音打扰到你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "谢谢……不过……我更想睡在你身边……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "主人总是熬夜，如果有我陪着的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "应该可以改掉你熬夜的坏习惯了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "毕竟……大家都说我是助眠神器，不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "葵……哎，可是现在还不到九点……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27544015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "嘘……已经关灯了，好了，快睡吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
